{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123109#pullrequestreview-5122103158","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123109","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123109#pullrequestreview-5122103158"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123109"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-05T16:51:17Z","commit_id":"5f285fd4a016ab60bf9244a1108bfd2d9340f41b"},{"id":5188058745,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNTt-eQ","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?u=6e9313e254649f6dc55e92536596487ac10bf5a2&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR needs more testing and review, but I'm giving it an initial approval after a quick glance at the code and testing on both macOS with a trackpad and Windows with a mouse.\n\n**Panning:**\nI noticed on Windows that this PR does indeed fix obviously broken panning/translation behaviour: in `master`, the zoom level has a direct impact on the effective panning speed, which is simply a bug. This PR resolves that issue so that effective pan speed is independent of the zoom level.\n\nOn macOS trackpad this PR feels good to me and the default speed is reasonable. In `master`, the default pan speed with my default DPI scale is unbearably slow, so this PR is a big improvement overall.\n\n**Orbit:**\nOn Windows I had a hard time noticing a difference between `master` and this PR.\n\nOn macOS with my default DPI scale, this PR is overall a big improvement because, like panning, orbit is way too slow in `master`. Likely DPI stuff fixed by this PR.\n\n**Free look:**\nOn Windows and macOS I noticed that this PR slows down the free look with default settings. It works well, though.\n\n**General notes:**\n\nBesides my change request, the only thing I'm uncertain about is the default free look speed. I think something like a factor of `2.0` is better, given this free look is normally used in combination with WASD to provide FPS-game-like movement through the virtual world.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123109#pullrequestreview-5188058745","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123109","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123109#pullrequestreview-5188058745"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123109"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-12T21:05:27Z","commit_id":"7beee7ec141791d96fc71074454a5656148ee370"}]